lmark.info/en/software/crystalmarkretro/crystalmarkretro-license/","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"CrystalMark Retro is a comprehensive benchmarking software that runs on Windows 95 and Windows NT 3.51 or later.\nIt supports 32-bit (x86), 64-bit (x64/ARM64), many-core, and multilingual (48+ languages) systems, and can measure CPU, Disk, 2D graphics (GDI), and 3D graphics (OpenGL) performance with a single click. Benchmark results can be registered in CrystalMarkDB for centralized management of past results (account required: free of charge) and comparison with data registered by users around the world.","moniker":"crystalmarkretro-aoi","name":"CrystalMark Retro Aoi Edition","packageUrl":"https://crystalmark.info/en/software/crystalmarkretro/","publisher":"Crystal Dew World","publisherUrl":"https://crystalmark.info/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://crystalmark.info/en/software/crystalmarkretro/crystalmarkretro-history/","tags":["benchmark","disk","drive","hdd","speed","ssd","storage","utility"]},"ja-JP":{"description":"総合的なベンチマーク ソフトウェアです。こちらは Aoi のテーマです。","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://crystalmark.info/ja/software/crystalmarkretro/crystalmarkretro-license/","locale":"ja-JP","longDescription":"CrystalMark Retro は、Windows 95 および Windows NT 3.51 以降で動作する総合ベンチマークソフトです。\n32bit (x86)、64bit（x64/ARM64）、メニーコア、多言語（48 言語以上）に対応し、CPU、ディスク、2D グラフィックス（GDI）、3D グラフィックス（OpenGL）の性能を 1 クリックで測定できます。また、ベンチマーク結果を CrystalMarkDB に登録することで、過去実績の一元管理（要アカウント：無償）や世界中のユーザーが登録したデータとの比較が可能です。","name":"CrystalMark Retro Aoi Edition","packageUrl":"https://crystalmark.info/ja/software/crystalmarkretro/","publisher":"Crystal Dew World","publisherUrl":"https://crystalmark.info/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://crystalmark.info/ja/software/crystalmarkretro/crystalmarkretro-history/","tags":["hdd","ssd","ストレージ","ディスク","ドライブ","ベンチマーク","ユーティリティ","速度"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"综合基准测试软件，Aoi 主题版本","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"CrystalMark Retro 是一款可在 Windows 95 和 Windows NT 3.51 或更高版本上运行的综合基准测试软件。\n它支持 32 位（x86）、64 位（x64/ARM64）、多核以及多语言（48 种以上语言）系统，只需单击一下即可测量 CPU、磁盘、2D 图形（GDI）和 3D 图形（OpenGL）性能。基准测试结果可注册到 CrystalMarkDB 中，以便集中管理以往的结果（需要免费注册账户），并可与全球用户注册的数据进行比较。","tags":["固态硬盘","基准","存储","工具","机械硬盘","硬盘","磁盘","跑分","速度","速率","驱动器"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://crystalmark.info/","releaseDate":"2026-02-19","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://crystalmark.info/en/software/crystalmarkretro/crystalmarkretro-history/","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/c/CrystalDewWorld/CrystalMarkRetro/AoiEdition/2.0.7/CrystalDewWorld.CrystalMarkRetro.AoiEdition.yaml","sha256":"96b7bd4121b9b2fe0128aa0df5abb661c27676d9078278cdc7e0bd45fedef8f1"},{"path":"manifests/c/CrystalDewWorld/CrystalMarkRetro/AoiEdition/2.0.7/CrystalDewWorld.CrystalMarkRetro.AoiEdition.installer.yaml","sha256":"ff096193d717f589b4be941a266e709f0031a75197b474df09895475e91dcfac"},{"path":"manifests/c/CrystalDewWorld/CrystalMarkRetro/AoiEdition/2.0.7/CrystalDewWorld.CrystalMarkRetro.AoiEdition.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"c5170092ff20c3a2c947d26958616849ec2f7f2000895525047d5401a0b6efbf"},{"path":"manifests/c/CrystalDewWorld/CrystalMarkRetro/AoiEdition/2.0.7/CrystalDewWorld.CrystalMarkRetro.AoiEdition.locale.ja-JP.yaml","sha256":"e24a411d8cb0bddfe4024aebfeb1333bc8e9312085d59df92f7f1c62cdd7b8f1"},{"path":"manifests/c/CrystalDewWorld/CrystalMarkRetro/AoiEdition/2.0.7/CrystalDewWorld.CrystalMarkRetro.AoiEdition.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"8a2e99df74376eec7470e1adc08cfeb5a2ec9c0d3f7a9e8b70335f85a2e791f6"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"2.0.7"}